window.products.push({"id":1041025,"name":"Rite Lite Blue & White Curlicue Seder Plate With Gold Accents - Elegant & Modern Pesach Seder Dish Recipe Hebrew & English Haggadah Traditional Jewish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CeKVWyUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cover the perfect item for every Passover Seder environment! Dry Clean Only. 3 pockets for the 3 Matzahs Trust the number 1 Judaica company for all your Passover needs: Rite Lite Ltd. is a leading manufacturer, importer and wholesaler of year-round, seasonal (Purim, Passover, Rosh Hashana, Chanukah, etc.) and occasion-based Jewish products (Judaica). Their extensive selection includes ceremonial items, gifts, decorations, serveware, educational toys and crafts, books and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CeKVWyUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rite Lite","source_asin":"B0BWPP73DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWPP73DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWPP73DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041026,"name":"Glass Gaiwan Teacup with Lid Saucer Gongfu Brewing Cup No Handle Tea Mug, 4 fl oz (Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sdIYVDGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enrich your tea drinking experience using this simple yet refined gaiwan. Looking very modern, the glass teaware piece allows you to make your perfect cup of tea following ancient Asian traditions. HIGHLIGHTS Gaiwan consists of a saucer, cup and lid. It is designed for both steeping and drinking tea.  The cup without a handle features a steady foot and flared shape that helps to reveal all nuances of the aroma.  The saucer allows you to hold safely your cup of hot tea.  The lid with a knob lets you push aside floating tea leaves.  The glass gaiwan doesn't affect the delicate flavor of the tea. It cools the liqour while steeping and offers you a unique opportunity to see the leaves unfurling and color of the liquor changing through multiple infusions.  Works best for oolong, white and green teas, Pu-erh, Chinese black teas. Less suitable for black teas and Japanese green teas. CARE TIPS Dishwasher and microwave safe. Use soft tissues or cloth to dry the glassware – this will keep the glass shiny and prevent scratches on the surface of the glass. Fight water stains with baking soda or lemon and hot water. Do not expose glassware to sudden extremes of temperatures (placing hot tea mug in the freezer is a recipe for disaster).  Don’t use metal spoons. It can lead to glass becoming weak. WARRANTYWe are sure about the high quality of our products. That's why we offer the 30-day money back guarantee on all tea accessories. If you don't like the brewing cup for any reason, return it within 30 days and get a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sdIYVDGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mueller Austria","source_asin":"B076PCTFL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076PCTFL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076PCTFL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
