window.products.push({"id":1041043,"name":"Epicurean Pizza Peel, w/Cutter Set, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZB3yOlktL._AC_.jpg","description":"Epicurean is a way of life-a reflection of our personal values and those of our customers. Every Epicurean tool and kitchen accessory is made with naturally renewable or recycled materials in an environmentally responsible way. Our products are well-designed, practical, casual tools that feel at home in any kitchen. Today, Epicurean cutting boards, kitchen tools and utensils are at the center of everyday life for both the casual cooks and seasoned gourmets. We pride ourselves on original designs that are simple, functional and beyond trend. Quality materials are carefully selected to be both durable and eco-friendly creating long-lasting products that balance performance with respect for the environment. Every Epicurean product is made in the U.S.A., creating good jobs and strengthening the economy. This Epicurean Pizza peel is perfect for building pizzas and slipping them in and out of the oven, slicing and serving. Epicurean pizza peels won't warp or crack like traditional wood pizza peels. Prep cut and serve all on the same surface with the Epicurean pizza peel. Temperature resistant up to 350 degrees, these can be used as a trivet and can be sliced right on the peel. Features a handle with hole for hanging and storage. Dishwasher safe. Epicurean pizza cutters are made with a non-porous composite from trees harvested under guidelines of the North America Sustainable Forestry Standards. This is the same material used in Epicurean cutting boards. With one simple roll action, the new Epicurean Pizza Cutter helps to divvy up slices of home baked pizza pies. Its beveled edge design makes it safe and effective to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZB3yOlktL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epicurean","source_asin":"B01CUTHHFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CUTHHFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CUTHHFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
