window.products.push({"id":1041227,"name":"Tweedmill Textiles Antique Royal Stewart Tartan Premium Wool Throw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":147.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zDwsJQT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A softer and thicker wool Tartan Travel Rug (as they are called in Scotland) this blanket is in the Antique Royal Stewart Tartan. The Royal Stewart tartan generally referred to simply as the Royal Tartan, has been associated with the Royal House of Stewart for several centuries. The Stewart monarchs were descended from Walter, High Steward of Scotland, who married Princess Marjory, daughter of King Robert the Bruce. Their son, King Robert II, was the first Stewart king. The male line of the Royal House of Stewart ended with the death of Prince Henry, brother of Prince Charles Edward. H.M. The Queen is chief of the Royal House of Stuart and “chief of chiefs”. Badge – Rowan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zDwsJQT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHDENUO","source_asin":"B0043XW170","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0043XW170","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0043XW170","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
