window.products.push({"id":1041266,"name":"Vollrath 68390 Wear-Ever 42 Qt Roast Pan Set, 21-5/8 x 18-1/8 x 9 In, Heavy Duty Aluminum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":542.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u1tV6VVPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This multi use aluminum roasting pan set can be used as a roaster and the top becomes a griddle. Easy to grab loop handle on all four sides of pan. Roast Pan with Cover, 42 quarts, Heavy-Duty Aluminum with loop riveted handles, 21 5/8\" x 18 1/8\" x 9, 4 ga., USA made, NSF","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u1tV6VVPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wear-Ever","source_asin":"B00263504U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00263504U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00263504U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041267,"name":"School Librarian Library Card Bookworm Reading for Women Cute Coffee Mug Tea Cup Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611VWMND-mL._AC_SL1271_.jpg","description":"Bookworm gifts are a great birthday gift for librarians, librarian appreciation gift, or librarian retirement gift. Also a great gift for avid readers or college students. This 11 ounce white ceramic coffee mug also makes a great tea cup with its large, easy to grip C-handle. The imprinted design will display on both sides of the mug as pictured, and will stop approximately 1 inch from both sides of C-handle. The premium full color sublimation imprint creates a vibrant, long lasting, and lead-free design. Microwave and dishwasher safe for your convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611VWMND-mL._AC_SL1271_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThisWear","source_asin":"B07BSGMY9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BSGMY9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BSGMY9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041268,"name":"Senegalo Extra Large Rainbow Herringbone Hooded Grass Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":240.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAzc9uPTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"* Extra large size basket* Colorful herringbone pattern* Hanging side handles and hooded lid* Made from grass and multicolored recycled plastic ribbons* Approx. 15\" widest diameter, 19\" without hood, 25\" height with hood* Each basket is hand woven, expect 1.5\" variations in dimensions* Weavers use varying colored plastic ribbons* Uses traditional coil style weaving technique* Handwoven by Wolof women* Made in Senegal --------------------- The Wolof people in Senegal are known for weaving colorful baskets from locally harvested cattail stalks and strips of plastic. They weave handmade baskets of different sizes and shapes over banter and shared laughs. These groups of women empower themselves and their tribe through the practice of this traditional craft.  Dakar, Senegal's capital city, is filled with many craft markets and artisan groups like the Wolof Women. The Wolof women are strong-willed and independent women. They are challenging patriarchal norms by becoming income earners in their households. The Wolof women bond over a mutual interest to eradicate poverty and provide better opportunities for their younger ones. This coil style of basket weaving has been practiced in Senegal for generations. The technique has been preserved by Wolof women by teaching their daughters and nieces. Traditionally, baskets were woven by binding thick local grass with thin strips of palm frond. Palm fronds were difficult to work with and were hard on the weavers' hands. So, recycled plastic ribbons were introduced to replace palm fronds. This simple change in material greatly reduced discomfort during the weaving process. Our collection Senegalo is a curated collection of colorful baskets, bowls and coasters. The collection is decorative and practical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAzc9uPTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senegalo","source_asin":"B09V9LC84X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V9LC84X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V9LC84X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041269,"name":"QUBIC INC HANDMADE COPPER JUG HAMMERED 51OZ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715IBgODjsL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"QUBIC produce the original Moscow Mule Copper Mugs. The Copper mugs are entirely handmade by skilled artisan, expect each mug to be unique with its own features, which makes it true to the Moscow mule experience. The copper mugs are 16 ounces -The Moscow Mule copper mugs is a vodka-based cocktail with the unusual addition of ginger beer. Vodka was still relatively unknown outside Russia and Central Europe in the years following World War II. Heublein president John Martin had recently purchased the Smirnoff name and recipe for his American company, and he was out to promote his new product. As the story goes, Martin stopped off for dinner and drinks at the Cock 'n' Bull on Sunset Strip, where his friend, owner Jack Morgan, was struggling to sell his homemade ginger beer. Add to the mix another friend who had inherited a large collection of copper mugs and a wedge of lime-and you have the Moscow Mule. Martin combined three seemingly hopeless endeavors into one of the most popular cocktails of the 1950s and early 1960s. He even got stars like Woody Allen to promote his concoction. -TO Prepare a moscow mule, you will need: - 1 Copper Mug - 1/2 lime - 2 ounces vodka - 4 to 6 ounces ginger beer, preferably homemade or Cock'n Bull or D&G Old Jamaica brands -Squeeze lime into Collins glass (or copper mugs) and drop in half lime. Add 2 or 3 large ice cubes, then pour in the vodka and fill with cold ginger beer. Serve with a stirring rod.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715IBgODjsL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUBIC INC","source_asin":"B01FQY1O18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FQY1O18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FQY1O18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
