window.products.push({"id":1041277,"name":"LOGIX 20911 Torch Lighters, Cooking Torch for Crème Brûlée, Butane Refillable, Mini, Culinary Torch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XHOomwmbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warm up your day with the LOGIX 20911 Butane Torch, designed for the kitchen, campground, handyman’s toolbox, craft shop, and more. With an average temperature of 2400 degrees Fahrenheit, the chef torch blasts the perfect amount of heat so you don’t burn or overheat your material. Press and hold the igniter switch on the mini butane torch for a searing flame stream, or lock the flame into place with the continuous flame mode for longer burning and detail work. The fire torch allows you to start a campfire, caramelize sugar, char cocktail garnishes, roast vegetables, melt cheese, shine chocolate, toast marshmallows, sear tomato skins, brown meringues, sear meat, light cigars, braze metal, solder jewelry, solder pipes, and fire metal clay. Designed for maximum precision, the handheld torch heats surfaces, metal, pipes, and food with accuracy with the pinpoint flame compared to the standard pocket lighter, which can be awkward to handle in smaller spaces or on uneven surfaces. Customize the length of the flame coming from the hand torch with the adjustable switch, located on the left side of the mini blow torch. Pack this flame torch into your camping gear to get your campfire started so you can break out the marshmallows and start making s’mores. If you’re a culinary genius, a camping aficionado, or a DIY champion, you’ll get a ton of use out of this lightweight and small butane torch with a comfortable grip. The butane torch can be used as a browning torch, a cocktail flame, a pastry torch, a sear torch, an art resin blow torch, and blow torch for baking, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XHOomwmbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logix","source_asin":"B09N4F2LWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N4F2LWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N4F2LWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
