window.products.push({"id":1041329,"name":"BeerSmith 2 Home Brewing Software (CD)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EFoO9yTLL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Design Great Beer at Home! Design award winning beers with BeerSmith 2 by matching the style and color of classic beers from around the world. Three years in the making, BeerSmith 2 has been redesigned from the ground up to give it a modern look and feel with ribbons, themes and tabbed browsing. Its designed to make your brewing day as easy as possible.BeerSmith 2 has been updated with tabbed browsing to make it easy to work with as many recipes and tools as you like. Tabbed browsing lets you open many recipes and tools at the same time and work with them in separate tabs. Users with large screens or multiple monitors can also open items in separate windows.NEW for the 21st CenturyNOW MAC COMPATIBLE!!!BeerSmith 2 is available for the first time on the Macintosh platform (all intel-based Macs with OSX/10.5/Leopard or higher) as well as Windows 7, Vista and XP. The Macintosh and PC versions are nearly identical, and share common file formats including BeerSmith 1.x support.Building a recipe in BeerSmith is as easy as picking ingredients off a list. Hundreds of preloaded ingredients are available including grains, hops, yeasts, misc ingredients and waters. As you add ingredients, the color, gravity and bitterness are updated automatically.Match your Favorite Beer StylesChoose from nearly 100 beer styles in our extensive BJCP style guide. BeerSmith graphically shows color, bitterness, gravity and alcohol comparisons against the style as you build your recipe. Generate step-by-step instructions for any recipe, customized to match your equipment and preferencesOrganize your recipes and folders by dragging and dropping them. Keep a log of recipes you have brewed. Share recipes in a variety of formats including BeerSmith 2 and BeerSmith 1 formats. Download recipes from around the web.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EFoO9yTLL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeerSmith","source_asin":"B0069RMSKI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0069RMSKI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0069RMSKI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
