window.products.push({"id":1041367,"name":"Foxemart L-Shaped Computer Desk, Industrial Corner Desk Writing Study Table with Storage Shelves, Space-Saving, Large Gaming Desk 2 Person Table for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rxT22bTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ LARGE SPACE & STORAGE - Foxemart L shaped with big desk panel and storage shelves can offer plenty of space for your keyboard and mouse when working, study, gaming, doing the industrial work in workstation, workbench and other home office activities. The dimension of the desk is: 51.2” (L) * 29.5''(H) * 18.9” (W). Size of the 2-tier open shelves is: Bottom shelf : 19.5” (H) * 12.6''(L) * 18.9” (W), which is high enough to put your computer host. Top shelf : 6.7” High. ★ STURDY X CROSSBAR DESIGN - Sturdy X crossbar will make this corner desk more stability and durability than others desks. This l-shaped desk is also come with the adjustable leg pads which can make your desk sturdy on uneven floor. And it can support a lot of heavy. ★ HIGH QUALITY & DURABLE - The corner desk is make of the high quality heavy duty powder coated steel frame and particleboard with scratch-resistant, anti-collision design. With the rustic brown and black mixed color design which make your desk looks more fashionable and stylish. ★ EASY INSTALLATION - All the install accessories with numbered parts and the detail install Manuel are includes with our L desk's package. Please follow the instructions manual step by step to install. NOTE: Do not use the non-match screw, which will cause the desk board broken. ★ RISK-FREE PURCHASE - We pursue quality and provide professional after-sales support. If you have any problem about L shaped desk, please feel free to contact Foxemart customer service at your earliest convenience. Our customer support team will address your concerns within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rxT22bTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foxemart","source_asin":"B0BFG3X1C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFG3X1C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFG3X1C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
