window.products.push({"id":1041369,"name":"Mauviel Made In France M'Heritage 11.8 Inch Oval Pan with Bronze Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gePQGx5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This lightweight oval pan--which measures 12 inches across--is designed not only for efficient oven or stovetop use, but also as an attractive serving dish when guests are present. Picture an elegant piece of lemon-covered salmon or a healthy serving of buttered asparagus gracing the bottom of the pan. The copper exterior measures 1.5 mm thick, which ensures that the pan heats quickly on the burner and cools just as rapidly when removed, making it an ideal choice for sautés and other rapid-response cooking methods. Chefs will also appreciate the matching bronze side handles, which make it easy to transport the pan from oven to table for serving. In addition to the copper exterior, Cuprinox Pour la Table cookware features a thin layer of stainless steel on the interior of each pot. The stainless surface protects the chef from the one drawback of copper--its highly reactive properties, which would otherwise impart a metallic taste while tarnishing easily. The stainless interior, on the other hand, resists sticking, doesn't react with acidic foods, and cleans easily with a sponge. Mauviel recommends hand washing the cookware, which carries a limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gePQGx5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mauviel","source_asin":"B0002L5FTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002L5FTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002L5FTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
