window.products.push({"id":1041563,"name":"Le Creuset Marseille Blue Enameled Cast Iron Mariner Star 5.5 Quart Round French Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W4ZOiNYhL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","description":"Chefs around the world prefer LeCreuset enameled cast iron for its cooking versatility and superior heat retention and the 5.5 quart Le Creuset Mariner Star Round French Oven adds a collector's quality. Honoring the year of Le Creuset's inception, only 1,925 of the limited edition Le Creuset Mariner Star Dutch oven were crafted and hand enameled in France. The lid's raised mariner star design was cast in one of a kind sand mold and the stainless steel lid knob is individually numbered and includes a display medallion. Beautiful for table presentation, the 5.5 quart round French oven colorful, long lasting exterior porcelain enamel resists scratches, chipping and cracking. Generously sized to slow cook one pot meals, meaty ribs or beef stew, the Le Creuset cast iron French oven is the lightest weight per quart of any premium cast iron cookware. The enameled cast iron Le Creuset Mariner Star Dutch oven ensures all ingredients cook at an even temperature and stay hot longer. Sand colored interior enamel helps monitor food as it cooks, preventing burning and sticking and does not react with foods. The premium porcelain enamel finish is resistant to odors and stains for a lifetime of use. No slide lid seals in moisture and flavors. Oversized loop handles ensure even weight distribution and secure lifting. Versatile for all cooktops, oven safe to 500 F and broiler-safe. PFOA and PTFE free. Dishwasher safe. Since 1925, Le Creuset has set the standard for exceptional craftsmanship, design, performance and quality. The premium cookware is an enduring favorite of home connoisseurs and mainstay of leading chefs and restaurateurs worldwide. This limited edition round French oven was inspired by the mariner star, a centuries old symbol found on compasses to navigate Mediterranean coast winds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W4ZOiNYhL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00N9S02YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N9S02YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N9S02YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
