window.products.push({"id":1041570,"name":"SleepJoy 2-inch Temperature Regulating Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Twin X-Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rN8iWdyxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sleep Joy 2-inch temperature regulating gel memory foam mattress topper regulates sleep surface temperatures resulting in a cooler, temperature- neutral environment. A patented process infuses premium density memory foam with micro-gel beads that sense where your body needs the most support, providing the personalized comfort that traditional memory foam can't. These micro-gel beads are enhanced with Phase change technology that pulls excess heat away from the body, resulting in a cooler sleep environment. Through a unique production process, foam odor is neutralized. Allover ventilation allows for greater airflow, creating a cooler, more hygienic sleeping environment. Open-cell memory foam construction offers superior durability that retains its shape over time and outlasts the competition. The topper comes with a breathable, moisture-wicking nano-tex coolest comfort zippered, skirted cover that protects and increases the lifespan of the mattress topper. Cover is machine washable/dryable. Made with plant-based ingredients, Sleep Joy memory foam has a lower impact on the environment. Whether you're looking to supplement your mattress that's in good condition, or restore the cushioning and support your mattress may have lost over time, the Sleep Joy 2-inch temperature regulating gel memory foam mattress topper is your solution. The mattress topper will work with fitted sheets of any Depth. Instantly upgrades any type of mattress; latex, memory foam or spring. Assembled in the USA of us and imported components. Sleep Joy is protected by a 5 year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rN8iWdyxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SleepJoy","source_asin":"B018F4BN8A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018F4BN8A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018F4BN8A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
