window.products.push({"id":1041843,"name":"DelbouTree Striped Duvet Cover Set,Grey Stripes Reverse to Solid Grey,3pcs Bedding Duvet Cover Set,Zipper Closure and Corner Ties,Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914txyNJhbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from 100% Microfiber,light Weight and Durable Fabric. Smooth and Soft. Cozy and Breathable. Reversible design, Casual stripe printed on one side and solid grey on the other side. Highly contrast contemporary design. Material used for this 3pcs duvet cover set is a dense and sturdy weave microfiber, lightweight, ultra soft and breathable. Smooth and gentle to the skin. Pet-Friendly too, very durable, If you have large pets sit or sleep on your bed, this duvet cover hold up nicely. Zipper Closure,Hidden zipper on the bottom, The Invisible zipper keeps it looking nice, and Soft to the touch. Zippered opening is wide enough to insert a huge duvet easily. 4 Corner ties in this duvet cover. Ribbons at all 4 corners are super helpful. the ribbons keep the cover from slipping, and the duvet inside will be hold in place instead of sliding. So it now stays put perfectly no matter how much you might toss or turn. DUVET COVER QUEEN Size set includes: 1 duvet cover measures 90x90 inch and 2 standard queen pillow shams 20x26 with a 3 inch flange. Duvet insert is NOT included in this set. Machine wash, This whole set fit well in the washer, The extra benefit is, after a wash, the fabric feels even softer. Dry on low heat or simply hang dry. No Fading, Wrinkle free. Great for pet owners too. Duvet cover is a protective out layer for the duvet. It can be very helpful for a dry clean only Duvet or a leaking feather down duvet. Way easier to clean a light weight duvet cover than cleaning a huge duvet. Changing up the look in your bedroom and add some interest. Using a duvet cover will be a perfect solution. At this cost, you can change it every season or holiday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914txyNJhbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DelbouTree","source_asin":"B06XXBYCSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XXBYCSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XXBYCSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
