window.products.push({"id":1041864,"name":"Large Clothing Storage Bags 119L Capacity Organizers for Blanket Comforter Clothes Pillows Foldable Containers for Closet Storage with Large Clear Win","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys0JTVDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA LARGE: the blanket storage bag is able to fit queen sized comforters, pillows, adult clothes and blankets into it. The size is 20\"L X 16.2\"W X 22.5\"H. REINFORCED DURABLE HANDLES: The handle is sewn with two layers of thick fabric, and the load-bearing capacity is doubled. Reinforced seams are also implemented for added strength. Strong portable carry handles on the end makes the bag slide easily from closet, shelves, basement, attic, cabinets or under the bed. 2 LARGE CLEAR WINDOWS: for easy viewing inside from up and side and identifying your garments. DURABLE SMOOTH ZIPPER: Equipped with 2 high quality zippers, can be used for a longer period of time, keeps your garments clean and tidy. Two-ways zippers allow it to easily slide along the closure when in use, regardless of how full the bag is. MULTIFUNCTIONAL: Multifunctional storage bag fits for cabinet, closet shelvin, under the bed, basement shelf, upstairs, attic, dorm, laundry, garage and vacation cottage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys0JTVDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elepbear","source_asin":"B07T6YBQ5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T6YBQ5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T6YBQ5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041865,"name":"The Song of Water Artwork by Mathieu Rivrin, 12 by 19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qCSqLuCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features rocks in the sand on a beach. Mathieu Rivrin was born in 1989 in Brest, a city in the northwestern part of France. He bought his first camera at age 21 to take photographs of Grenoble, the city where he conducted his studies. He became a member of Breizh'scapes, a collective of six landscape photographers in Western France, in November of 2012. Since then he has built a collection of landscape photographs, taken in HDR, providing a greater dynamic range of luminosity than most photographs provide. He also plans to start creating more architectural images in the future. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qCSqLuCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00HHUFSNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HHUFSNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HHUFSNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041866,"name":"Vintage Crystal Champagne Coupe Gold Rim Glasses | Set of 4 | 7 oz, Gilded Rim Classic Cocktail Glassware - Martini, Manhattan, Cosmopolitan, Sidecar,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MknEX88jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four Gold Coupe Goblet Glasses makes a wonderful gift for lovers of fine champagne. Each elegant glass is perfectly weighted to keep your bubbles smooth and steady, with a elegant stem. They will become your favorite go-to glass for any celebration from memorable anniversaries to weddings and parties! Each glass is handmade by skilled artisans in our workshop and made of crystal that sparkles and shines to enhance your drinking experience. The elegant design will have you feeling like royalty. A Set of 4 Vintage Champagne Coupe Gold Rim Goblet Glasses 7oz by The Wine Savant, is a beautiful way to complete any bar. These are great for any event: Wedding Party, Anniversaries, Cocktail Party, Martini's and more. This design will give a touch of elegance to your next classic party. Your friends will surely enjoy drinking out of these glasses that are made with high quality borosilicate glass. Make your next celebration wonderful with this set of 4 vintage champagne coupe goblets. These beautiful gold rim goblets are made from high quality glass, making them durable, sturdy and perfect for enjoying Champagne. Not only do they make presentation at the table look impressive, but they also make opening a bottle of bubbly even more fun. Get ready for your guests to rave about this new addition to your barware collection! Our vintage inspired gold champagne coupes are perfect for any bar, home or venue. Our exquisite glasses are made from superior-grade hand blown glass. This set of 4 champagne glasses will help you make the perfect toast to your friends and family at any special occasion. These beautiful coupe goblet glasses are sure to turn heads as they add a touch of luxury to your home bar, wedding or party table. Add a special touch to your celebration with this set of 4 gold rimmed champagne coupe glasses. The champagne coupe is widely considered to be the most romantic of drinking vessels. So you and your friends are celebrating the special event of a life time. Make it extra special by adding these 4 vintage gold rimmed champagne coupe glasses to the mix! Whether you're sharing a bottle of champagne, wine or cocktails, these classy glasses are sure to impress your guests.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MknEX88jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0BV1PWF25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV1PWF25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV1PWF25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
