window.products.push({"id":1041967,"name":"Queen Size- Solid CHERRY Platform Bed Frame - 100% Clean - UNFINISHED, No Toxins - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ydEEzLYwL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for strength, elegance and affordability in a platform bed then you have found it! This sleek, yet solid design is simply a great bed at a great price. Made with sustainable CHERRY wood, this bed represents one the very best values in platform bed frames anywhere on the market. That's because our solid cherry platform beds are designed to be simple and attractive; yet very affordable and strong beyond comparison. For those experiencing Chemical Sensitivity, or for those who are just generally concerned about introducing toxins into your personal space, you can rest assured that there are NO CHEMICALS (absolutely none) in this product! This is 100% clean and clear, natural, untreated unfinished wood! You may also be interested in our All Natural Unfinished Pine or Oak Platform Beds. Like all platform beds, this frame does not require the use of a foundation or box spring. We use Southern Yellow Pine bed slats for their strength to create a solid platform for your mattress while this also allows room for good air circulation. Outside bed height is 15 Inches and your mattress or futon will drop into a slightly recessed area (approx. 1/4 inch-1/2 inch). Under-bed clearance is approx. 10 Inches below the rail, so lots of storage space! Under bed storage drawers are available and sold separately. This bed comes ready-to-assemble, and assembly is so easy! There are no tools required; the (2) hex wrenches you need for assembly are included. As with all of our solid wood, American-made furniture, you also get a 10 Year Warranty. So get your solid cherry hardwood platform bed from the Room Doctor today, and get ready to sleep well! *Clean & Green and HAND MADE IN USA*MATERIAL: Made of Premium Cherry *Overall Dimensions: 61 7/8\" W x 83\" L x 15\" H. (image size shown here is Full Size)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ydEEzLYwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Room Doctor Platform Beds","source_asin":"B004G49N2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004G49N2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004G49N2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041968,"name":"Cotton Delight King Size Fitted Sheet Blue 800 Thread Count 100% Natural Cotton Fitted Sheet King Size with 21\" Extra Deep Pocket - Breathable, Soft &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bPjgtK3PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Natural cotton 800 thread count fitted sheets are the true definition of luxury and comfort, These linens are some of the most sought after products for the discerning natural cotton connoisseur and the finest hotels and resorts in the world. Purchasing this fitted sheets will completely revitalize your sleeping experience! These fitted sheets are ideal to pair with our natural cotton flat sheets, pillow covers and luxury comforters to give your bedroom the look and feel of a 5-star hotel. They are 100% natural cotton and available in a wide range of colors and sizes! Why is natural cotton so much better for your fitted sheets ? Quite simply, natural cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest fabric you will ever sleep under. It's that simple! \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a shams feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer fitted sheets with an elegant drape. Our Single ply fitted sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lighter-weight fabric with exceptional drape and softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bPjgtK3PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cotton Delight","source_asin":"B081D2J6JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D2J6JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D2J6JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1041969,"name":"Joyce Chen , 5-Piece Stoneware Teapot Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6jLUqC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 5 -Piece. Stoneware Teapot set includes a Side Handle Teapot, 20 oz capacity and 4 - 4 oz. Cups. The uncomplicated beauty of this classic design is presented in white. This teapot is NOT for stovetop. Joyce Chen's slogan -InchEastern Cookware for the Western Kitchen-Inch, reflects her focus on providing high-quality, versatile tools and products that have Asian flair, but can be used in a western kitchen. Joyce Chen opened her first restaurant in Cambridge, Massachusetts in 1958. The restaurant flourished, and in 1973 a larger Cambridge restaurant was opened. Chen also began writing Chinese cookbooks and in the 1970s began hosting a cooking show on public television. She found that the selection and quality of Chinese cookware in America didn't live up to her high standards so she developed her own. Today, Joyce Chen Products come from all over the Pacific Rim to bring the best of Asia to you.- 20-Ounce. Teapot, 4/4-Ounce Tea Cups, White.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6jLUqC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYCE CHEN","source_asin":"B0040QDVY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1041969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0040QDVY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0040QDVY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
